imud-influxdb (1.6.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New udp_enabled and http_enabled keys (both may run at once) replace
    the transport = "udp"|"http" selector. transport is DEPRECATED but
    still honoured — when neither enable is set it maps to the matching
    output with a one-time warning. The stock config ships the daemon
    enabled with every output off.
  * Fix: enabled = false no longer crash-loops under systemd (Type=notify)
    — the bridge signals readiness before exiting cleanly.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

