imud-influxdb (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against imud packet v12 (228 bytes).
  * Export the full v12 diagnostic set: gyro-bias estimate (gbias_x/y/z), its
    variance (gbias_var_x/y/z), the accel-quiescence metric (quiescence), heave
    rate (heave_rate), and a heave_valid boolean. As the diagnostics sink, heave
    is still emitted from t=0 so the pre-settle transient stays visible.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 03:00:00 -0700

